.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-template-deploy - New server from a template


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro template deploy  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
New server from a template

.PP
A normal prepaid tr-ist-1 order (24-hour balance rule, account limits) installed from the template. \fBproduct_id\fR (or \fBplan\fR) from GET /cloud/products?region=tr-ist-1; \fBregion\fR resolves the plan name (default \fBtr-ist-1\fR; Gyro Cloud Istanbul and Turkey VDS plans are both in tr-ist-1); the plan disk must be at least the template \fBmin_disk_gb\fR\&. Send \fB"confirm": true\fR and an \fBIdempotency-Key\fR header (\fBdry_run\fR for a quote). Turkey VDS plans are billed with the plan's normal invoice: the first period (default monthly; \fBcycle\fR = a period the plan offers: monthly, semiannually, annually or biennially) is paid from the balance at order time and the order is not placed if the balance is not enough; later periods are billed as usual. \fBcycle\fR is ignored for Gyro Cloud Istanbul plans; an invalid period returns 422 \fBcycle_invalid\fR with the allowed \fBcycles\fR\&. On a \fBdry_run\fR quote a Turkey VDS plan returns \fBcycle\fR, \fBbilling: "invoice"\fR, \fBtotal\fR and \fBtax\fR\&.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/templates/{id}/servers (operationId createServerFromTemplate, scope cloud_order)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--cycle\fP=""
	Period of the first invoice, only for Turkey VDS plans: monthly (default), semiannually, annually or biennially (the periods the plan offers). Ignored for Gyro Cloud Istanbul plans; an invalid value = 422 cycle_invalid with the allowed cycles list.

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for deploy

.PP
\fB--hostname\fP=""
	hostname

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--plan\fP=""
	plan

.PP
\fB--product-id\fP=0
	product_id

.PP
\fB--project-id\fP=0
	Optional project for the new service(s) (0 = default project). Checked before the order: unknown id = 404 \fBproject_not_found\fR (GyroAPI order endpoints) or 422 \fBcheckout_blocked\fR with \fB[project_not_found]\fR (POST /orders).

.PP
\fB--region\fP=""
	Region used to resolve the plan name (default tr-ist-1; Gyro Cloud Istanbul and Turkey VDS plans are both in tr-ist-1).

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--ssh-keys\fP=[]
	ssh_keys

.PP
\fB--user-data\fP=""
	user_data


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--account\fP=""
	act in another account you are a panel user of (id from \fBgyro account list\fR; "self" = your own; env GYRO_ACCOUNT, profile default: \fBgyro account use\fR)

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


